├── <span style="color:#7aa2d6;font-weight:600">  internal/</span> <span style="opacity:.55">(10 files, 38.8KB)</span>
│   └── <span style="opacity:.55">... 3 directories</span>
├── <span style="color:#7aa2d6;font-weight:600">  limits/</span> <span style="opacity:.55">(3 files, 8.8KB, all .go)</span>
<span style="opacity:.55">   ... 14 more directories</span></pre></div><figcaption class="cap">Orientation. Structure plus hubs, budgeted to fit a session-start hook.</figcaption></figure>
    <figure style="margin:0"><div class="term"><div class="bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="t">codemap --importers config/config.go</span></div><pre>⚠️  HUB FILE: config/config.go
   Imported by 40 files - changes have wide impact!

   Dependents:
   • blast_radius.go
   • blast_radius_fixes_test.go
   • cmd/config.go
   • cmd/config_more_test.go
   • cmd/config_test.go
   ... and 35 more
Coverage: complete</pre></div><figcaption class="cap">Blast radius. Asked before an edit, not after the PR is red.</figcaption></figure>
    <figure style="margin:0"><div class="term"><div class="bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="t">codemap find "session timer"</span></div><pre>Bell/Controller/Home/HomeViewController.swift
  matched: presentFinishedSessionPanel, finishedSessionSaved, createAndShowTimerPanel, prepNextSession, displayFinishedSessionPanel
