  </div>
</section>

<section class="ways" id="ways">
  <div class="kicker">Use it your way</div>
  <h2 style="margin-top:12px">Agents first. Same binary, four doors.</h2>
  <div class="tabs" role="tablist">
    <button class="tab on" role="tab" data-t="mcp">codemap mcp</button>
    <button class="tab" role="tab" data-t="hooks">codemap setup</button>
    <button class="tab" role="tab" data-t="cli">CLI</button>
    <button class="tab" role="tab" data-t="ci">CI</button>
  </div>
  <div class="panes">
    <div class="pane on" data-p="mcp"><div class="term"><div class="bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="t">MCP over stdio, 19 tools</span></div><pre>$ claude mcp add codemap -- codemap mcp
$ codex mcp add codemap -- codemap mcp

# tools an agent calls
get_structure   get_dependencies   get_importers   get_diff
find            get_file_context   get_hubs        get_handoff
get_working_set list_skills        get_skill       status</pre></div><p class="muted" style="margin-top:12px">Typed structured content on the five graph tools, so an agent parses a result instead of prose. Every result carries the coverage line.</p></div>
    <div class="pane" data-p="hooks"><div class="term"><div class="bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="t">hooks for Claude Code and Codex</span></div><pre>$ cd your-repo && codemap setup
  wrote .codemap/config.json (auto-detected)
  merged hooks into .claude/settings.local.json
  merged hooks into .codex/hooks.json
  configured MCP in .mcp.json and .codex/config.toml

# what the agent then sees before it edits a hub
⚠️  HUB FILE: config/config.go · 40 importers</pre></div><p class="muted" style="margin-top:12px">Session start, prompt submit, pre-edit, post-edit, pre-compact. Advisory, never blocking.</p></div>
    <div class="pane" data-p="cli"><div class="term"><div class="bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="t">terminal</span></div><pre>$ brew tap JordanCoin/tap && brew install codemap
$ codemap .                        # structure + hubs
$ codemap --importers path/to/file # who depends on this
$ codemap find "session timer"     # ranked, with importer counts
$ codemap --diff                   # what changed vs main
$ codemap collide                  # open PRs that share hot files</pre></div><p class="muted" style="margin-top:12px">One static binary. macOS, Linux, Windows. MIT.</p></div>
    <div class="pane" data-p="ci"><div class="term"><div class="bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="t">.github/workflows/collide.yml</span></div><pre>on: [pull_request]
jobs:
  collide:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v7
        with: &#123; fetch-depth: 0 &#125;
      - uses: JordanCoin/codemap-ci@main
        with:
          github-token: $&#123;&#123; github.token &#125;&#125;</pre></div><p class="muted" style="margin-top:12px">Pair-builds the open PRs that share hot files, on your runners. Verdict on the PR in about 16 seconds on our own repos.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ints" id="integrations">
  <div class="kicker">Integrations</div>
  <h2 style="margin-top:12px">One source of truth. Every surface your team reads.</h2>
  <p class="muted" style="margin-top:14px">Agents and your repo feed the CLI. The CLI computes the facts once, with a coverage line attached. Each surface renders the same facts, so a manager in Jira sees the honesty an engineer sees in the terminal. Hover a node to trace its wire.</p>
  <div class="flowwrap">
<svg class="flow-svg" viewBox="0 0 1200 600" role="img" aria-label="Agents and your repo feed codemap; codemap feeds GitHub, Slack, Linear, Jira, Confluence, FigJam, Miro, Notion, VS Code and Backstage">
<defs><filter id="soft" x="-20%" y="-20%" width="140%" height="140%"><feGaussianBlur stdDeviation="1.2"/></filter></defs>
<path id="pi0" class="wire in" d="M174,135.0 C347.0,135.0 347.0,300.0 520,300.0"/>
<circle r="3.2" class="pkt in"><animateMotion dur="2.60s" begin="0.0s" repeatCount="indefinite"><mpath href="#pi0"/></animateMotion></circle>
<path id="pi1" class="wire in" d="M174,245.0 C347.0,245.0 347.0,300.0 520,300.0"/>
<circle r="3.2" class="pkt in"><animateMotion dur="2.95s" begin="0.6s" repeatCount="indefinite"><mpath href="#pi1"/></animateMotion></circle>
<path id="pi2" class="wire in" d="M174,355.0 C347.0,355.0 347.0,300.0 520,300.0"/>
<circle r="3.2" class="pkt in"><animateMotion dur="3.30s" begin="1.2s" repeatCount="indefinite"><mpath href="#pi2"/></animateMotion></circle>
<path id="pi3" class="wire in" d="M174,465.0 C347.0,465.0 347.0,300.0 520,300.0"/>
<circle r="3.2" class="pkt in"><animateMotion dur="3.65s" begin="1.8s" repeatCount="indefinite"><mpath href="#pi3"/></animateMotion></circle>
<path id="po0" class="wire out live" d="M680,300.0 C818.0,300.0 818.0,40.0 956,40.0"/>
<circle r="3.2" class="pkt out live"><animateMotion dur="3.00s" begin="0.8s" repeatCount="indefinite"><mpath href="#po0"/></animateMotion></circle>
<path id="po1" class="wire out soon" d="M680,300.0 C818.0,300.0 818.0,97.77777777777777 956,97.77777777777777"/>
<path id="po2" class="wire out soon" d="M680,300.0 C818.0,300.0 818.0,155.55555555555554 956,155.55555555555554"/>
